Confirm \cmd|pwd| matches the disposable \texttt{utp24}
directory in \cmd|"$practice"|. Remove only the three
named files and decline any unexpected prompt. If you
skipped jq, \texttt{review.json} may not exist.

\begin{terminal}
rm -i ./photos.csv ./photos.json ./review.json
cd /tmp
rmdir "$practice"
\end{terminal}

Inspect any unexpected leftover instead of forcing removal.
If you started a separate \cmd|sh|, type \cmd|exit|.
